     3338       return.
     3339    end.
     3340   if p-curr-host-code <> ? then do:
     3341     find first X_curr_sysconf no-lock where
     3342                     X_curr_sysconf.host-code = p-curr-host-code no-error.
     3343     if not available X_curr_sysconf then do:
