     3559     v-db-num @ v-corr-user-db-num
     3560     sch-db-num
     3561     sch-corr-date
     3562     sch-wth-code
     3563     sch-corr-user-name
     3564     mark-num
     3565     WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3566     ENABLE
     3567     v-corr-user-db-num
